          <div className="whitepaper__supply-key"><span><i />Venda pública · {formatTokenCount(tokenomics.publicSaleAllocation)}</span><span><i />Fundador e time · {formatTokenCount(tokenomics.teamAllocation)}</span><span><i />Investidores e fundo · {formatTokenCount(tokenomics.investorAllocation)}</span></div>
